        "TileImage": "$($repository 743f058f-56a0-420f-8b5e-46dababaca37).Image",
        "Description": "47. \r\rYou are assigned a second set of High Value Targets (HVTs) in the slums of Mumbai, India. Below are the listed targets as well as the preferred kill methods;\r\rEliminate &quot;Mike&quot; with a sniper rifle.\rEliminate Rima Shah with Fibre wire.\rEliminate Gurdeep Gokhale with consumed lethal poison.\rEliminate both Saloni and Bhavin Sagar with a barber razor\r\rLots of eyes and civilians around, so collateral, non-target casualties are strictly off-the-table for this contract. \r\rBest of luck!\rReapingZ",
